S HOUSE REPUBLICANS ELECT JIM JORDAN AS PARTY LEADER FOR THE NEXT CONGRESS -PUNCHBOWL NEWS","display_text_range":[0,91],"facets":[]},"author":{"screen_name":"DeItaone","url":"https://x.com/DeItaone","id":"2704294333","followers":1973196,"following":40,"likes":8348,"media_count":6129,"statuses":197083,"name":"*Walter Bloomberg","description":"","raw_description":{"text":"","facets":[]},"location":"Geneva, Switzerland","banner_url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/2704294333/1771002964","avatar_url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2088360110095478784/El9anzXH_200x200.jpg","joined":"Sun Aug 03 14:34:52 +0000 2014","protected":false,"website":null,"verification":{"verified":true,"verified_at":null,"type":"individual"},"type":"profile"},"replies":36,"reposts":11,"likes":198,"bookmarks":7,"quotes":3,"embed_card":"tweet","created_at":"Tue Nov 10 19:20:43 +0000 2026","created_timestamp":1794338443,"views":119849,"is_note_tweet":false,"community_note":null,"lang":"en","replying_to":null,"media":{},"provider":"twitter","reposted_by":null},{"type":"status","url":"https://x.com/DeItaone/status/2120232705845793230","id":"2120232705845793230","text":"$NVDA  - NVIDIA HIRES TOP WALL STREET LAW FIRM TO INVESTIGATE JENSEN HUANG\n\nNvidia has hired Wachtell Lipton to investigate CEO Jensen Huang's admitted affair with a Chinese executive accused of espionage, according to The New York Times.\n\nThe investigation will be led by Joon H. Kim, a former acting US attorney who helped investigate former New York Governor Andrew Cuomo.\n\nNvidia's board says it has no reason to believe company secrets or national security were compromised, but will examine all available evidence. Huang has pledged full cooperation.\n\nThe investigation puts Nvidia's co-founder and CEO under unprecedented board scrutiny.","raw_text":{"text":"$NVDA  - NVIDIA HIRES TOP WALL STREET LAW FIRM TO INVESTIGATE JENSEN HUANG\n\nNvidia has hired Wachtell Lipton to investigate CEO Jensen Huang's admitted affair with a Chinese executive accused of espionage, according to The New York Times.\n\nThe investigation will be led by Joon H. Kim, a former acting US attorney who helped investigate former New York Governor Andrew Cuomo.\n\nNvidia's board says it has no reason to believe company secrets or national security were compromised, but will examine all available evidence. Huang has pledged full cooperation.\n\nThe investigation puts Nvidia's co-founder and CEO under unprecedented board scrutiny.","display_text_range":[0,644],"facets":[{"type":"symbol","indices":[0,5],"original":"NVDA"},{"type":"bold","indices":[8,74]}]},"author":{"screen_name":"DeItaone","url":"https://x.com/DeItaone","id":"2704294333","followers":1973196,"following":40,"likes":8348,"media_count":6129,"statuses":197083,"name":"*Walter Bloomberg","description":"","raw_description":{"text":"","facets":[]},"location":"Geneva, Switzerland","banner_url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/2704294333/1771002964","avatar_url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2088360110095478784/El9anzXH_200x200.jpg","joined":"Sun Aug 03 14:34:52 +0000 2014","protected":false,"website":null,"verification":{"verified":true,"verified_at":null,"type":"individual"},"type":"profile"},"replies":71,"reposts":101,"likes":965,"bookmarks":89,"quotes":22,"embed_card":"tweet","created_at":"Tue Nov 10 19:10:43 +0000 2026","created_timestamp":1794337843,"views":215025,"is_note_tweet":true,"community_note":null,"lang":"en","replying_to":null,"media":{},"provider":"twitter","reposted_by":null},{"type":"status","url":"https://x.com/DeItaone/status/2120226048520405178","id":"2120226048520405178","text":"DEMOCRATIC SENATE LEADER SCHUMER CALLS TRUMP'S DEFENSE OF NVIDIA'S HUANG \"TROUBLING\"\n\nSCHUMER SAYS FULL ACCOUNTING FOR TRUMP’S ALLEGED \"FAILURE TO ADDRESS FOREIGN ESPIONAGE IN THE AMERICAN TECH INDUSTRY\" NEEDED","raw_text":{"text":"DEMOCRATIC SENATE LEADER SCHUMER CALLS TRUMP'S DEFENSE OF NVIDIA'S HUANG \"TROUBLING\"\n\nSCHUMER SAYS FULL ACCOUNTING FOR TRUMP’S ALLEGED \"FAILURE TO ADDRESS FOREIGN ESPIONAGE IN THE AMERICAN TECH INDUSTRY\" NEEDED","display_text_range":[0,210],"facets":[]},"author":{"screen_name":"DeItaone","url":"https://x.com/DeItaone","id":"2704294333","followers":1973196,"following":40,"likes":8348,"media_count":6129,"statuses":197083,"name":"*Walter Bloomberg","description":"","raw_description":{"text":"","facets":[]},"location":"Geneva, Switzerland","banner_url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/2704294333/1771002964","avatar_url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2088360110095478784/El9anzXH_200x200.jpg","joined":"Sun Aug 03 14:34:52 +0000 2014","protected":false,"website":null,"verification":{"verified":true,"verified_at":null,"type":"individual"},"type":"profile"},"replies":29,"reposts":38,"likes":315,"bookmarks":19,"quotes":12,"embed_card":"tweet","created_at":"Tue Nov 10 18:44:16 +0000 2026","created_timestamp":1794336256,"views":142073,"is_note_tweet":false,"community_note":null,"lang":"en","replying_to":null,"media":{},"provider":"twitter","reposted_by":null},{"type":"status","url":"https://x.com/DeItaone/status/2120215727294816623","id":"2120215727294816623","text":"US 10-YEAR TREASURY AUCTION SEES WEAKER DEMAND AS YIELD TOPS 5%\n\nThe US Treasury sold $42 billion in 10-year notes at a high yield of 5.02%, above the 5.010% when-issued yield before the auction.\n\nThe bid-to-cover ratio fell to 2.46 from 2.77 at the previous auction, signaling weaker investor demand.\n\nThe auction tailed by 1 basis point, as investors demanded a higher yield to absorb the debt.\n\nTreasury yields are back above 5%, adding pressure to bonds, borrowing costs and equity valuations.","raw_text":{"text":"US 10-YEAR TREASURY AUCTION SEES WEAKER DEMAND AS YIELD TOPS 5%\n\nThe US Treasury sold $42 billion in 10-year notes at a high yield of 5.02%, above the 5.010% when-issued yield before the auction.\n\nThe bid-to-cover ratio fell to 2.46 from 2.77 at the previous auction, signaling weaker investor demand.\n\nThe auction tailed by 1 basis point, as investors demanded a higher yield to absorb the debt.\n\nTreasury yields are back above 5%, adding pressure to bonds, borrowing costs and equity valuations.","display_text_range":[0,497],"facets":[{"type":"bold","indices":[0,63]}]},"author":{"screen_name":"DeItaone","url":"https://x.com/DeItaone","id":"2704294333","followers":1973196,"following":40,"likes":8348,"media_count":6129,"statuses":197083,"name":"*Walter Bloomberg","description":"","raw_description":{"text":"","facets":[]},"location":"Geneva, Switzerland","banner_url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/2704294333/1771002964","avatar_url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2088360110095478784/El9anzXH_200x200.jpg","joined":"Sun Aug 03 14:34:52 +0000 2014","protected":false,"website":null,"verification":{"verified":true,"verified_at":null,"type":"individual"},"type":"profile"},"replies":42,"reposts":56,"likes":272,"bookmarks":31,"quotes":13,"embed_card":"tweet","created_at":"Tue Nov 10 18:03:15 +0000 2026","created_timestamp":1794333795,"views":118319,"is_note_tweet":true,"community_note":null,"lang":"en","replying_to":null,"media":{},"provider":"twitter","reposted_by":null},{"type":"status","url":"https://x.com/DeItaone/status/2120212120239223194","id":"2120212120239223194","text":"GERMANY FACES NEW JOB CUTS AS ECONOMIC RECOVERY FALTERS\n\nNearly one-third of German companies plan to cut jobs in 2027, according to a survey of more than 1,000 firms by the German Economic Institute (IW).\n\n32% expect layoffs, up from 29% in spring, while only one in six plans to hire.\n\nNearly 40% intend to reduce investment, and 80% expect production to stagnate or decline.\n\nGermany's GDP growth slowed to 0.2% in Q3, while 47% of industrial firms report worsening business conditions.\n\nIW warns Germany's brief recovery could end in 2027, with business expectations stuck in their longest slump since 2005.","raw_text":{"text":"GERMANY FACES NEW JOB CUTS AS ECONOMIC RECOVERY FALTERS\n\nNearly one-third of German companies plan to cut jobs in 2027, according to a survey of more than 1,000 firms by the German Economic Institute (IW).\n\n32% expect layoffs, up from 29% in spring, while only one in six plans to hire.\n\nNearly 40% intend to reduce investment, and 80% expect production to stagnate or decline.\n\nGermany's GDP growth slowed to 0.2% in Q3, while 47% of industrial firms report worsening business conditions.\n\nIW warns Germany's brief recovery could end in 2027, with business expectations stuck in their longest slump since 2005.","display_text_range":[0,611],"facets":[{"type":"bold","indices":[0,55]}]},"author":{"screen_name":"DeItaone","url":"https://x.com/DeItaone","id":"2704294333","followers":1973196,"following":40,"likes":8348,"media_count":6129,"statuses":197083,"name":"*Walter Bloomberg","description":"","raw_description":{"text":"","facets":[]},"location":"Geneva, Switzerland","banner_url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/2704294333/1771002964","avatar_url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2088360110095478784/El9anzXH_200x200.jpg","joined":"Sun Aug 03 14:34:52 +0000 2014","protected":false,"website":null,"verification":{"verified":true,"verified_at":null,"type":"individual"},"type":"profile"},"replies":25,"reposts":37,"likes":291,"bookmarks":42,"quotes":14,"embed_card":"tweet","created_at":"Tue Nov 10 17:48:55 +0000 2026","created_timestamp":1794332935,"views":129987,"is_note_tweet":true,"community_note":null,"lang":"en","replying_to":null,"media":{},"provider":"twitter","reposted_by":null},{"type":"status","url":"https://x.com/DeItaone/status/2120209483326754854","id":"2120209483326754854","text":"U.S. STOCKS EXTEND FALL, S&P 500 <.SPX> DOWN 1.00 PCT","raw_text":{"text":"U.S. STOCKS EXTEND FALL, S&amp;P 500 &lt;.SPX&gt; DOWN 1.00 PCT","display_text_range":[0,63],"facets":[]},"author":{"screen_name":"DeItaone","url":"https://x.com/DeItaone","id":"2704294333","followers":1973196,"follo